    "body": "This repository is meant for improving the HTML Standard. I tend to agree with the assessment that there does not seem to be overlap between what HTML defines and SSML defines. It seems a discussion around SSML would be more appropriate on https://lists.w3.org/Archives/Public/www-voice/, given that's what the standard itself encourages.",
